{"id":"u-8ef40af4-337e-4ada-a56c-9841e426979d","src":"community","title":"4 day powerlifting","author":"Liam O.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/GZznjv-4-day-powerlifting","desc":"Build strength over 12 weeks with an Upper (horizontal focused), Lower (squat), Upper (vertical focused), Lower (deadlift) split.\n\nHit the main compound lifts for 2 sets of max effort, and then another 2 sets of higher rep volume work at RPE 9, for stimulus and technique. For the first 2 sets, speed and power are key. For second 2 sets, stimulus and technique are key.\n\nAll accessories should be 2-3 sets of near max effort.\n\nAll warm ups at 5-8 reps up until 50% of 1rm, and then 3 reps in between 50% and 75%, and 1 rep in between 75% and working weight.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-23T12:10:20.696Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":10},{"r":3,"rpe":10},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pendlay Row","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":10},{"r":3,"rpe":10},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":10},{"r":3,"rpe":10},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Single Arm)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift